  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd46f4c48ea13f644b49af6b289fdb82, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mahiru shard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSequence:
  - text: N-No.$.$. $$Not this stair again.$.$.
    displayText: N-No... Not this stair again...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 050000000600000008000000080000001d0000001e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But we have to see everything.$.$.
    displayText: But we have to see everything...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6ba46ecacc866544da47236fc876b59f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika sees Mahiru standing on the stairs alone, $$with a piece of paper
      and a sealed box placed beside her. $$She looks like she's trying to think
      of something to write on the paper.
    displayText: Rika sees Mahiru standing on the stairs alone, with a piece of paper
      and a sealed box placed beside her. She looks like she's trying to think of
      something to write on the paper.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2f0000002f0000006900000069000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Is.$.$. $$Is that a gift..? $$So this is before she gave it to my mother,
      $$huh.$.$.?
    displayText: Is... Is that a gift..? So this is before she gave it to my mother,
      huh...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 03000000040000000600000006000000180000001800000044000000440000004800000049000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```"Ah.$.$. $$Why is it this hard to think of something with good meanings.$.$.
      $$It''s even harder than the essay homework.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Ah... Why is it this hard to think of something with good meanings...
      It''s even harder than the essay homework..."'
    color: 6
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.41, b: 0.71, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 04000000050000000700000007000000440000004500000047000000470000007000000071000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```"Happy birthday, $$Rika-chan.$.$.? $$No, $$no. $$That''s too simple.$.$.
      $$How about, $$$I $love $you.$.$.?"'
    displayText: '"Happy birthday, Rika-chan...? No, no. That''s too simple... How
      about, I love you...?"'
    color: 6
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.41, b: 0.71, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 11000000110000001b0000001c0000001f0000001f00000023000000230000002700000027000000390000003a0000003c0000003c000000470000004700000047000000490000004e0000005200000053000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Why is she thinking so hard about a birthday note.$.$.? $$Can't she just
      not put a note in?
    displayText: Why is she thinking so hard about a birthday note...? Can't she
      just not put a note in?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fe9e64057009084a9c5653faca90639, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 32000000330000003600000036000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's because she saw you as her friend. $$And she actually has a message
      for you, $$she still hasn't formalized it yet.
    displayText: It's because she saw you as her friend. And she actually has a message
      for you, she still hasn't formalized it yet.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 28000000280000005000000050000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "```Mahiru blushed a little at the thought of confessing. $$But she quickly
      got to the thinking mode again.\r"
    displayText: "Mahiru blushed a little at the thought of confessing. But she quickly
      got to the thinking mode again.\r"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3600000036000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```"Hmm.$.$. $$Rika always looks lonely, $$but she is a bit more happy
      with me around.$.$. $$But I can''t be around her all the time. $$So that means.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Hmm... Rika always looks lonely, but she is a bit more happy with
      me around... But I can''t be around her all the time. So that means..."'
    color: 6
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.41, b: 0.71, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0500000006000000080000000800000022000000220000004d0000004e000000500000005000000078000000780000008600000087000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Mahiru finally thought of something and quickly scribbled it down.'
    displayText: Mahiru finally thought of something and quickly scribbled it down.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```"Rika.$.$. $$You are nice.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Rika... You are nice..."'
    color: 6
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.41, b: 0.71, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 060000000700000009000000090000001600000017000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```"Everyone wants to be friends with you.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Everyone wants to be friends with you..."'
    color: 6
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.41, b: 0.71, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2700000028000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```"Let''s have fun together with them in the future!"'
    displayText: '"Let''s have fun together with them in the future!"'
    color: 6
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.41, b: 0.71, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Mahiru looked up, $$proud of what she just wrote. $$Then, $$she stuck
      that paper onto the gift box, $$and moved happily to some other place.'
    displayText: Mahiru looked up, proud of what she just wrote. Then, she stuck
      that paper onto the gift box, and moved happily to some other place.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mahiru
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1200000012000000300000003000000036000000360000005e0000005e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 708777bab44cd2f45b2812ba56f77be9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Haha.$.$. $$Of course, $$what did I expect?
    displayText: Haha... Of course, what did I expect?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a32fafbf821b6c84ca74a356f7b9b009, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 050000000600000008000000080000001300000013000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's exactly the same thing that she said to me on that day, $$Friday,
      $$4th of April.$.$.
    displayText: It's exactly the same thing that she said to me on that day, Friday,
      4th of April...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 163aeeba01ab15e40828b78dd5e2482f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3d0000003d00000045000000450000005200000053000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The same thing that leads to her death.$.$.
    displayText: The same thing that leads to her death...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 708777bab44cd2f45b2812ba56f77be9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2700000028000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But that's what she thinks is best for you.
    displayText: But that's what she thinks is best for you.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yeah.$.$. $$She's naive. $$She's never seen the dark side of the world.
    displayText: Yeah... She's naive. She's never seen the dark side of the world.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 050000000600000008000000080000001500000015000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She never knew how someone like me can ever respond to positivity with
      pure hatred.$.$.
    displayText: She never knew how someone like me can ever respond to positivity
      with pure hatred...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 5300000054000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: At least, $$you understand her now. $$She would appreciate it if you think
      of her fondly, $$even if she's in the next world.
    displayText: At least, you understand her now. She would appreciate it if you
      think of her fondly, even if she's in the next world.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000a00000022000000220000005600000056000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But whether I can do that.$.$. $$I don't know.$.$.
    displayText: But whether I can do that... I don't know...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1a0000001b0000001d0000001d0000002a0000002b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Let's move on, $$Rika.$.$.
    displayText: Let's move on, Rika...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1899c048cbc3cbf46ad8477960b7a91e, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0f0000000f0000001400000015000000
    functionCalls: []
  _currentLineIndex: -1
